WEBVTT

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.950
The man you wish to see is right here.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.410
Huh?

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.370
Is this some kind of sickness?

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.000
Tell me, Father.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.290
What is the unseen council?

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.870
Nin!

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:45.290
Belo!

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.040
I'll kill you...

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.830
Belo is probably where he usually is...

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:07.370
I thought that might be the case.

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.910
This is the third time we have met.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.660
You finally told me on our third meeting.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:20.910
Now, I finally understand why you
called out to me in the first place.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.160
Will you tell me your name?

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.410
This is a new experience...

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.870
My name is Bem.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.080
Bem.

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.620
Please stay as you are.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.080
Are you sure?

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.250
Isn't that your true form?

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:43.870
Yes...

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.660
I heard there are two others.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.750
You will meet them eventually.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.700
I want to be your friend.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.200
Friend?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.950
It pains you...

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.540
...to be a humanoid monster.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:04.330
I can be the one to remove that pain.

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:08.200
That's what I believed, back then.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.040
That is why I took action.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.120
We are currently in Outside.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:17.790
Here is Gavin Briggs,
who represents the Briggs Foundation,

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.750
a world-wide medical equipment company

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:23.370
famous for helping refugees
and war orphans internationally.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:27.040
He plans to begin research
on humanoid monsters.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.040
It's finally starting, Representative.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.250
Thank you.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.540
I'll get straight to the point.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:36.750
What are your current plans for treatment
for these humanoid monsters?

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:42.290
I believe that humanoid monsters
are inflicted by some kind of disease.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.910
If that is the case, there must be
some method to cure them of it.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.620
I have the technology and facilities
for something like that.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.450
We will begin with examining the site.

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:57.830
Now, will they truly be able to come
in contact with the humanoid monsters?

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.950
We will continue to keep you updated
about Mr. Briggs and his efforts.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:06.040
I wonder if he'll meet the humanoid
monsters. I want to meet them!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.040
I wonder if I'll meet them?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.330
Let's go. Everyone is waiting.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.410
Oh, that's right.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.450
Haven't you been close to him lately?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.830
That's not true.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.870
Stop it. Other people will
start calling you creepy, too.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:25.080
The people of this city lack imagination,

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.660
especially those from Upper Town.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:32.160
The rich must carry
the responsibilities of the rich.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:39.080
But the people toss aside everything
they don't want to see to the Outside.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:43.750
The crimes committed outside their city
and the victims created by them...

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:49.040
The fact that people are being murdered
in war zones and children are going hungry...

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:53.200
They can't imagine the pain and suffering.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.250
That is a sin and a violent act
against the heart.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:01.790
Bem, you are another thing
they want to avert their eyes from.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.040
That's why you're in pain.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.410
This area hasn't changed at all.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.660
Wasn't this where you
grew up, representative?

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.870
Yes.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:17.160
Oh, please don't record this part.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.830
Manager.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:26.830
Do you remember me? I was a regular here.

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.790
This place was heaven back then.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.200
Can't recall.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.830
Hey, are you children always here?

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.910
Who is this guy?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.330
If you don't want to go to school,
you don't have to.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.500
If you don't want to go home,
you don't have to.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.290
What's with you?

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.410
I understand that there are circumstances.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.040
It was the same for me.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:52.000
But I wanted you to know there are adults
you can feel at ease around, too.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.040
It's like he's showing off...

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.580
So suspicious.

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.580
You should quit having expectations.

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:19.290
The humanoid monster research by
Mr. Briggs has yet to provide big results.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:24.330
However, it seems they have been
able to gain much in other areas.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:28.120
I realize now just how inadequate
this living environment is.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:33.410
For humans to be human, it is necessary
for them to have stability in their lives.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:38.160
That passion of his still hasn't changed.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:42.830
I may not look it, but I'm
pretty strong in a fight.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:48.660
Until I crossed that bridge to Upper
at the age of 13, I never lost a fight.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:54.040
I crossed that bridge with dreams in my heart.
Upper Town looked so dazzling.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.790
However, something was off.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.500
No one cared about Outside.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.660
Even though they could see
the other side of that bridge.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.250
That is why I decided to fight.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.620
I wanted to save everyone.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.910
Such beautiful words...

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.700
I wonder if that person will come again.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:17.450
A smiling adult proves they're lying.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.950
He's so nice that he's suspicious.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.450
So, we can't trust him, after all?

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:26.580
I mean, look. He's just advertising
himself using all those cameras.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.410
Nin. Nin.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.620
Run!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.330
Belo?!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.200
Run! Hurry!

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.250
Everyone, go back home!

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:02.250
Didn't he stab you?!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.330
I'm fine. Hurry up and go home!

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.580
No! My Dad'll hit me.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.700
I won't go home, either.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.250
I'll be alone tonight, too.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.330
I want to be with Belo.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:13.160
I don't want Belo to disappear!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:16.910
On 67th, there's a shop
with an old man named John.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.580
Tell him my name and you'll be safe.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.580
Go!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.700
No one can be saved with pretty words.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.450
And, it's impossible to do it alone.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.660
That is why I started my business.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:39.200
In order to do what I want to do,
I have to stand on top or no one will listen.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.620
If you want people to listen,

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.410
you have to have money and status.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.450
That is quite a vulgarian way of thought.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:54.370
Vulgarian? Fine. I need power to change
this town, this country, and this world.

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:59.950
However, I will not use this power
for myself. I will use it for my ideals.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.620
Ideals come from love.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.250
If you reach out your hand for someone,

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.250
that is love.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.580
I will not use my money for myself;
I will use it for the sake of the people.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:18.370
That's right, Bem. For your sake, as well.

00:10:18.370 --> 00:10:21.040
I will make you human.

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.250
Do you really think I can become human?

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.910
You've lost everything.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.120
You are talking about the incident.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.410
Bribery.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:36.200
Although they say there is
no smoke where there is no fire.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:40.200
People involved that I had never met...

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.250
Documents I had never seen...

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:45.250
No matter how much I claimed innocence,

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:52.750
the media scrums and news coverage were
skewed so that everyone saw me as guilty.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.660
Even though I am a medical supply maker,
they even called me the merchant of death.

00:10:56.660 --> 00:11:00.160
For them, lighting a fire is easy.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.830
"Them," you say?

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:05.000
Have you heard of them?

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:10.750
In Libra City, they are often plausibly
mentioned. The <i>unseen council</i> .

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.120
The unseen council.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:18.160
This is the first I've heard of them.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.830
Even now, the suspicion against
Mr. Briggs continues to rise.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.160
Though unconfirmed, the possibility

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:34.290
of his involvement in assisting
conflicts for money has surfaced.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.790
Do you think this is really true?

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.410
Impossible. I am innocent!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:43.080
Wouldn't that mean this man
was deceiving the whole world?

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:46.200
His efforts to heal humanoid monsters, too...

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:50.540
But I don't think this man was lying.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:57.540
Why can't you see them? This council.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:12:00.950
Just as the name implies,
no one knows their faces.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.700
However, they control
this city with an iron thumb.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:08.580
They are people who can affect
a country and even the world.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.700
They can turn lies into truths.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:13.910
Things that I do not remember happening

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:17.700
are coming to light
according to another's script.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:21.250
It was more horrifying than any
horror movie I had ever seen.

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:25.870
Because of that, I was suddenly outed
as the evil boss of the Outside.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:29.580
Even the death of Representative Carver
has been pinned on me.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:33.950
They say that you ordered me to kill him.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.750
Carver was a comrade of mine.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:42.290
I was given the guilty verdict because
I requested that you assassinate him.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.160
I watched that trial.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.870
So, you were there.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.250
Why did they decide you were guilty?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.830
That is because those people
are the true merchants of death.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:56.450
I took actions to stop the conflicts...

00:12:56.450 --> 00:13:03.040
They couldn't forgive me for moving
a politician I cannot name, in that favor.

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.750
And that politician?

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.750
He was erased.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:16.700
I have been thinking,
you don't drink very much.

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:18.700
There is no meaning.

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:24.500
We cannot taste anything we swallow.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.290
We can live as long as we have water.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:30.910
That is very lonely.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.410
We do not even know
why we were born in this world.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:41.000
Humans are the same.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.830
From the beginning, there are no answers.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:45.500
When you are born, you head toward death.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:48.160
That is the fate of living creatures.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.620
However, everyone tries to live in a way

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.790
that satisfies them before their death.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:14:00.080
It pains me to see people die unfairly.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.200
I want to stop them.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:04.200
Even death does not come to us.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.450
We just continue in the long flow of time.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.870
I have seen many types of humans.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:16.250
All of them have lived the best
they could with what life they had.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:22.750
Yes. There is great meaning
for humans to have a lifespan.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:27.370
In all this time, my answer has never changed.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.790
I want to become human.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:36.250
So that is why you appeared before me.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.410
So, it was you.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.290
Would you like to get a drink?

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.580
Wasn't it today?

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.540
The day that the boss of the
humanoid monsters is released?

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.000
Boss?

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.450
You knew him, didn't you?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.620
Are you talking about Gavin Briggs?

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.410
You're not going to see him?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:44.040
The suspicions of him being
their boss were never proven.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:52.750
You always asked me so many
questions every time we drank.

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:59.040
You asked why I help others.
Why I put others before myself.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.750
You must have been testing me.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.870
Testing to see if I was trustworthy.

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:08.580
I have not given up.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:15.410
Though I have nothing left,
since I used all my money for bail,

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:19.580
my heart still burns with love.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.120
I will save you, for sure.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.330
Why go so far to help people?

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:29.870
I cannot look away and ignore something.

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:32.540
That's all there is to it.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:38.620
What have you been doing all this time?

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:40.660
The same as you.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.450
Helping people...

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:53.500
If we continue to help humans,
we will one day become human ourselves.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:57.450
That is what we have always believed.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:04.500
I do not know how that could be a path
to becoming human and why we thought it so.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:09.200
One day, we just began to think
in that manner and started to act.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.950
However, I believe there is worth
in believing that it is true.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:19.200
You were always near me.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.040
You were always watching me.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.290
There is no longer any need to hide.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.870
I am with you.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.410
Are you not afraid?

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:29.120
Didn't I tell you?

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.160
I want to be your friend.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.370
Seriously?!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:45.700
Nin...

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:48.790
Nin!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:51.500
Stuff like that doesn't scare me.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:17:59.040
Nin!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.790
Will you show me your whole self?

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:15.700
Please.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.410
Nice to meet you, Bem.

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:02.080
Belo!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:02.080
Bem, this is bad!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:05.870
Nin! Nin! Nin!

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:11.450
This is the guy that killed Carver and Bryson.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.700
Nin. Nin. Nin!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:22.000
Ja! Ja!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.160
Ja! Ja! Ja!

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:26.580
Ja!

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:32.830
Ja! Ja! Ja! Ja!

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:37.540
Nin!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:41.450
Watch out!

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:43.500
Run!

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:51.870
Nin!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.080
Nin! Nin! Nin...

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:05.120
Nin! Nin!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.910
Nin!

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:57.910
That man tried to protect me...

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:01.120
Yeah... But we couldn't protect him...

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:27.120
Beta and Gamma have been confirmed.

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:29.080
Continue immediate pursuit.

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:41.250
This way.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:43.080
The body of Gavin Briggs,

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:47.250
the Briggs Foundation ex-representative,
was found in Outside.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:50.790
The police have concluded this to be
the work of the humanoid monsters.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:55.160
Though Mr. Briggs made effort to save
them, he came under much suspicion...

00:21:55.160 --> 00:22:01.000
Father, you found out so much
about the unseen council.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.330
Of course, you were targeted...

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:06.330
But, I'm different from you.

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:25.870
Welcome, my little knight.
